{"id":"c863f810e7db6d65","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-tukey-mcc.md","title":"Teichmüller–Tukey Lemma","display":"thm-tukey-mcc — Teichmüller–Tukey Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-tukey-mcc","aliases":["58-thm-tukey-mcc"],"display":"thm-tukey-mcc — Teichmüller–Tukey Lemma","depends_on":["[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-tukey-mcc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-tukey-mcc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tukey-mcc — Teichmüller–Tukey Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3dac4cf78c440c7\" href=\"?note=b3dac4cf78c440c7\" title=\"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md\">../batch01/58-ax-ac.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> is defined below</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\\forall s\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(|s|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to s\\in\\mathcal F\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\\forall s\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(|s|&lt;\\aleph_0\\to s\\in\\mathcal F\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}mcc} \\vdash \\emptyset\\neq\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(M\\subseteq A\\to A=M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}mcc} \\vdash \\emptyset\\neq\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(M\\subseteq A\\to A=M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A family has finite character when membership is determined by all finite subsets; this makes the union of every chain in the family an upper bound still belonging to the family.</li>\n<li>Over ZF, the Teichmüller–Tukey lemma is equivalent to the axiom of choice. It is unrelated to the Tukey cofinality order used in pcf theory and cardinal invariants.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-ax-ac.md","status":"resolved","id":"b3dac4cf78c440c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-ax-ac.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finite\\text{-}character} \\vdash \\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\left(A\\in\\mathcal F\\leftrightarrow\\forall s\\subseteq A\\;\\bigl(|s|<\\aleph_0\\to s\\in\\mathcal F\\bigr)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tukey\\text{-}mcc} \\vdash \\emptyset\\neq\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathrm{FiniteCharacter}_S(\\mathcal F,X)\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(M\\subseteq A\\to A=M)","display":true}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4467","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-tukey-mcc.md|58-thm-tukey-mcc]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","b3dac4cf78c440c7"]}